# Testing & docs

## Automated tests live here

| Type | Location |
|------|----------|
| Gateway live acceptance | `backend/gateway/scripts/**/*.test.ts` |
| In-process RBAC gates | `backend/gateway/src/rbac/check-rbac.ts` |
| Chapter acceptance | `backend/services/*/src/**/check-chapter*-acceptance.ts` |
| Jest unit | `backend/services/*/**/*.spec.ts` |

## When user asks to test a chapter

1. Open `docs/TESTING-GUIDES-INDEX.md` — run listed npm script only
2. Do not rewrite the testing guide unless asked to update docs
3. Prefer `npm run test:*` over manual curl unless debugging one endpoint

## Doc rules

- ADRs: `docs/*-COMPLETE.md` — do not duplicate in new files
- New testing guides: follow structure of `docs/DRIVER-CHAPTER-6-TESTING-GUIDE.md`
- Link related guides; keep under ~400 lines with tables not prose walls
